<title>HONG KONG: Lucky Man changes name to DC Finance.</title>
<headline>Lucky Man changes name to DC Finance.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lucky Man Holdings Ltd has changed its name to DC Finance (Holdings) Ltd, the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The name change comes into effect on Friday, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
